# NOTE:- cd commands:
- `cd` - Change directory
- `cd ..` - Move up one directory 
- `cd ~` - Move to the home directory
- `cd -` - Move to the previous directory
- `cd /` - Move to the root directory
- `cd <directory_name>` - Move to a specific directory
- `cd ../<directory_name>` - Move up one directory and then into a specific directory
- `cd ../../<directory_name>` - Move up two directories and then into a specific directory
- `cd /path/to/directory` - Move to a specific directory using an absolute path

